                  "settings": {
                    "editor": "<p>Keep this WordPress page in <strong>Draft</strong> status until Medexos Surgical Enterprises reviews and completes every flagged item below. Once approved and published, the theme footer automatically adds the link.</p><ul><li><strong>[REVIEW REQUIRED]</strong> Name and registered physical address of the Data Controller.</li><li><strong>[REVIEW REQUIRED]</strong> Web hosting provider name, server location, and log retention period.</li><li><strong>[REVIEW REQUIRED]</strong> Disclosure of external services used on the live WordPress site (WhatsApp click-to-chat, Google Fonts or self-hosted fonts, contact form plugins, analytics, or cookie consent tool).</li><li><strong>[REVIEW REQUIRED]</strong> Applicable data protection laws (e.g., GDPR for EU visitors, UK GDPR, or local regulations) and data retention periods.</li></ul>",
